- `Sources/Core/Jobs/Jobs.hpp`, `Jobs.cpp`: generic bounded worker pool and caller-thread completion queue.
- `Sources/Models/Internal/TextureStreaming.hpp`, `TextureStreaming.cpp`: deferred texture source graph, scheduler, generation safety and completion commit.
- `Sources/Models/Core/Texture.hpp`, `Texture.cpp`: existing public synchronous texture API plus storage hooks used by streaming internals.
